<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s199S">Because you have done <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w1">wrong sex</span>, you live in a place where there is <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w2"><span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s199m2">piss</span> and <span class="u" data-d="7" data-l="s199m1">shit</span></span> all around, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w3">mud and dirt</span> and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w4">filth</span>, and everything <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w5">stinks</span>, and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w6">everywhere</span> seems unpleasant and <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s199w7">distasteful</span>.</span>
