<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; Provisional machine alignment by Codex (English-first proposal). The causal/topic frame is distributed across GMR's supplied ‘Because you have done’ wording and is omitted. mi gtsang ba and nyams mi dga' ba are omitted rather than nulled because the compressed list does not uniquely assign the single remaining ‘filth’ and ‘unpleasant’ exponents; Rule 10 bars forcing either atom. Conjunctions and supplied scene-setting words remain unwrapped.</div>
